  "overview": "Giyu is the defensive cornerstone of S-Tier. His exclusive Water Breathing Eleventh Form (Dead Calm) is one of only two counterattack moves in the game that extends Guard duration, creating a neutral parry window unavailable to any other character. Giyu's overall toolkit is the most efficiently defensive: high damage output, the safest Normal combo in the game (-2 on block on the fifth hit, vs. the standard -4), and Dead Calm as a hard counter to aggressive pressure. His weakness is mobility—Giyu has the slowest movement speed of any swordsman, making approach and neutral footsies less effective than his counterparts.",
  "overviewJa": "義勇はSランクの防衛の要。専用の水の呼吸拾壱ノ型（凪）はゲーム中2つしかないガード持続を延長するカウンターアタック技の一つで、他キャラには存在しない中立パリィウィンドウを生成。全体的なツールキットが最も効率的な防衛型：高ダメージ出力、ゲーム最も安全な通常コンボ（5段目ガード時-2、標準-4より優秀）、積極的な圧力への完全カウンターとしての凪。弱点は機動性—義勇は全剣士中最も移動速度が遅く、アプローチと中立フットワークが他キャラより劣る。",
