  "tips": [
    "Dead Calm is the most powerful single defensive tool in the game—but it must be activated before the opponent's attack comes out. Read the opponent's patterns and pre-activate Dead Calm during their attack wind-up.",
    "At -2 on block, Giyu's Normal combo final hit is the safest in the game. Against other S-Tier characters who are -4 on block, Giyu can walk up and throw immediately after their blocked Normal 5.",
    "Giyu's slow movement is a weakness—compensate with Whirlpool (Skill 2) for zone control, which limits how freely opponents can approach without entering its range.",
    "Against Zenitsu, use Dead Calm when you predict a Thunderclap approach. Dead Calm absorbs the entire Thunderclap and Flash—even the Sixfold variant—turning his highest-burst move into a fully confirmed punish."
  ],
  "tipsJa": [
    "凪はゲーム最強の単体防衛ツール—ただし相手の攻撃が発動する前に起動する必要がある。相手のパターンを読み、攻撃の溜め中に凪を先読み起動。",
    "ガード時-2という安全な通常コンボ最終ヒットを活かす。ガード時-4の他Sランクキャラクターに対し、彼らのブロックされた通常5段の直後にダッシュ投げが確定する。",
    "移動速度の遅さは弱点—ねじれ渦（技2）でゾーンコントロールして相手が自由に接近するのを制限することで補う。",
    "善逸には霹靂一閃アプローチを予測して凪を使う。凪は霹靂一閃の全体—六連バリアントも含む—を吸収し、彼の最高バーストを完全確定パニッシュに変換。"
